  "description": {
    "raw": "Shield creates an invisible shield of force that hovers in front of you. It negates magic missile attacks directed at you. The disk also provides a +4 shield bonus to AC. This bonus applies against incorporeal touch attacks, since it is a force effect. The shield has no armor check penalty or arcane spell failure chance.",
    "search_text": "\"shield creates an invisible shield of force that hovers in front of you. it negates magic missile attacks directed at you. the disk also provides a +4 shield bonus to ac. this bonus applies against incorporeal touch attacks, since it is a force effect. the shield has no armor check penalty or arcane spell failure chance.\"",
    "sections": []
  },
